ionales for disputed pairs to the eight-pair calibration review. This message clarifies the existing criterion; it does not create a new numerical threshold.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:response-preference-faq@1.1:4683724f\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"response-preference-faq@1.1\", \"title\": \"Response Preference — FAQ (v1.1)\", \"sections\": [\"Ties and preferences\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"response-preference-faq\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"faq\", \"record_kind\": \"faq\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-05T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-05T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"response_preference\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U001\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Ties and preferences\\n\\n### Q: How much improvement is needed to avoid a tie?\\nThe difference must offer a meaningful benefit to the user. Cosmetic phrasing alone usually does not. Explain that benefit; otherwise a tie can be appropriate.\\n\\n### Q: QA is reversing ties on similar pairs. What should I do?\\nShare the pairs, relevant prompt constraints and both rationales for calibration. Check whether the cases are actually comparable. An answer to one pair should not be generalized without matching its scope.\"}], \"open_review_flags\": [{\"origin\": \"agent1\", \"kind\": \"inherited_agent1_review\", \"candidate_group_id\": \"cluster_2d814c8e21470de9\", \"member_ids\": [\"member_0d9923ad